# Generated output and caches.
.nuxt/
.output/
dist/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.pnpm-store/

# Spec-kit's scaffolding and the speckit-* skills it installs are taken from
# upstream whole.
.specify/
.agents/skills/speckit-*/
.claude/skills/speckit-*/

# Vendored third-party skills are kept byte-identical to their upstream
# (AGENTS.md § Vendored agent customizations); formatting them would make the
# fixtures something no user of those skills has. Each one is ignored by name —
# never by its whole parent directory, so a skill authored in this repository is
# formatted like any other source. Taking a new vendored skill includes adding
# its line here.
.agents/skills/plugin-creator/
.agents/skills/skill-creator/
.claude/skills/skill-creator/

# Markdown is authored prose in two languages with deliberate wrapping, and
# the vendor contracts contain tables frozen by recorded SHA-256 digests
# (contracts/official-sources.md); a formatter rewriting either would change
# meaning-bearing bytes.
*.md

# Files their owning tools generate and rewrite.
pnpm-lock.yaml
skills-lock.json
.claude/settings.local.json
